s </span><span begin="00:46.972" end="00:47.612">you </span><span begin="00:47.612" end="00:48.308">like</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:52.796" end="00:59.260"><span begin="00:52.796" end="00:53.020">I </span><span begin="00:53.020" end="00:53.324">don't </span><span begin="00:53.324" end="00:53.828">want </span><span begin="00:53.828" end="00:54.125">to </span><span begin="00:54.125" end="00:55.596">hug</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:59.260" end="01:05.492"><span begin="00:59.260" end="00:59.452">I </span><span begin="00:59.452" end="00:59.892">just </span><span begin="00:59.892" end="01:00.484">want </span><span begin="01:00.484" end="01:00.692">to </span><span begin="01:00.692" end="01:01.844">sleep</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:05.492" end="01:10.332"><span begin="01:05.492" end="01:05.764">The </span><span begin="01:05.764" end="01:06.492">smell </span><span begin="01:06.492" end="01:06.804">of </span><span begin="01:06.804" end="01:07.388">your </span><span begin="01:07.388" end="01:08.476">hair</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:10.332" end="01:20.403"><span begin="01:10.332" end="01:12.005">Reminds </span><span begin="01:12.005" end="01:12.316">me </span><span begin="01:12.316" end="01:13.164">of </span><span begin="01:13.164" end="01:13.836">her </span><span begin="01:13.836" end="01:14.580">feet</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:20.403" end="01:26.619"><span begin="01:20.403" end="01:20.611">So </span><span begin="01:20.611" end="01:21.059">don't </span><span begin="01:21.059" end="01:21.723">wait </span><span begin="01:21.723" end="01:22.915">outside </span><span begin="01:22.915" end="01:23.467">my </span><span begin="01:23.467" end="01:24.283">hotel </span><span begin="01:24.283" end="01:25.323">room</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:26.619" end="01:33.219"><span begin="01:26.619" end="01:27.027">Just </span><span begin="01:27.027" end="01:27.707">wait </span><span begin="01:27.707" end="01:28.315">till </span><span begin="01:28.315" end="01:28.683">I </span><span begin="01:28.683" end="01:29.171">give </span><span begin="01:29.171" end="01:29.859">you </span><span begin="01:29.859" end="01:30.067">a </span><span begin="01:30.067" end="01:30.963">sign</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:33.219" end="01:44.952"><span begin="01:33.219" end="01:33.467">'Cause </span><span begin="01:33.467" end="01:35.424">I </span><span begin="01:35.424" end="01:37.144">get </span><span begin="01:37.144" end="01:38.080">lonesome </span><span begin="01:39.080" end="01:41.184">sometimes</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:44.952" end="01:52.040"><span begin="01:44.952" end="01:45.777">Save </span><span begin="01:45.777" end="01:46.320">all </span><span begin="01:46.320" end="01:46.600">the </span><span begin="01:46.600" end="01:48.328">jokes </span><span begin="01:48.328" end="01:48.896">you're </span><span begin="01:48.896" end="01:49.712">going </span><span begin="01:49.712" end="01:50.040">to </span><span begin="01:50.040" end="01:51.176">make</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:52.040" end="01:59.381"><span begin="01:52.040" end="01:52.477">Whilst </span><span begin="01:52.477" end="01:53.013">I </span><span begin="01:53.013" end="01:53.981">see </span><span begin="01:53.981" end="01:54.573">how </span><span begin="01:54.573" end="01:54.821">much </span><span begin="01:54.821" end="01:55.693">drink </span><span begin="01:55.693" end="01:56.109">I </span><span begin="01:56.109" end="01:56.437">can </span><span begin="01:56.437" end="01:57.509">take</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:59.381" end="02:24.172"><span begin="01:59.381" end="01:59.773">Then </span><span begin="01:59.773" end="02:03.157">be </span><span begin="02:03.157" end="02:05.791">my </span><span begin="02:05.791" end="02:07.695">mistake</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:24.172" end="02:30.879"><span begin="02:24.172" end="02:24.404">I </span><span begin="02:24.404" end="02:25.543">shouldn't </span><span begin="02:25.543" 